    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061129.0187\n\nHIROSHIMA, Japan, Nov. 29 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nResults of men's volleyball world championship (update 1)\n\n\n\n\nFollowing are the results from the second round matches of 2006 men's volleyball world championships in Japan on Tuesday:\n\nGroup E in Sendai:\n\nPuerto Rico lost to Tunisia, 2-3 (40-38, 26-28, 25-16, 22-25, 11-15);\n\nArgentina lost to Canada, 2-3 (25-19, 25-18, 21-25, 20-25, 13- 15);\n\nPoland bt Serbia Montenegro, 3-0 (28-26, 25-19, 25-19);\n\nJapan vs Russia;\n\nGroup F in Hiroshima:\n\nBrazil bt Bulgaria, 3-1 (25-22, 20-25, 25-22, 25-16);\n\nCuba lost to United States, 0-3 (22-25, 17-25, 22-25);\n\nGermany lost to Czech Republic, 1-3 (23-25, 27-25, 21-25, 13-25)\n\nFrance vs Italy;",
